{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "description": "四轨协作文件所有权与工单白名单配置（Backend / Flutter / Admin / Integration）。由 scripts/collaboration/scope-check.mjs 读取。两种检查模式：① workorder 模式（CI 默认，经 --branch 或 --workorder 解析）：判定顺序 = globalForbid → 生成产物（非 integration lane）→ lane.forbid → 工单白名单（workorders[<id>].allow 精确放行，pending 待定项永不放行）→ 越界；② legacy 模式（仅 --lane）：判定顺序 = globalForbid → 生成产物 → lane.forbid → lane.exceptions（唯一工作单例外，当前一律未授权）→ lane.allow → 越界。路径统一为正斜杠，模式支持 **（跨目录）、*（单段内）、?（单字符）。",
  "globalForbid": [],
  "generatedProducts": [
    "backend/src/contracts/capabilities.js",
    "backend/src/contracts/inventory-report.json",
    "backend/src/modules/ai/services/assistant-catalog.generated.js",
    "backend/admin/src/apiCatalog.js",
    "app/lib/core/feature_catalog.dart"
  ],
  "branchMap": [
    { "branch": "collab/116g-backend-*", "lane": "backend",     "workorder": "116g-A" },
    { "branch": "collab/116h-flutter-*", "lane": "flutter",     "workorder": "116h-A" },
    { "branch": "collab/116g-admin-*",   "lane": "admin",       "workorder": "116g-B" },
    { "branch": "collab/integration-*",  "lane": "integration", "workorder": "116g-X" }
  ],
  "workorders": {
    "116g-A": {
      "lane": "backend",
